# Lord of Atlantis: "Other Merfolk get +1/+1 and have islandwalk." Bot1's Cenote Scout, a 1/1 Merfolk, is a 2/2 with
# islandwalk (CR 613.4c, 613.1f); the Lord itself is "other" to nothing and stays a 2/2 without it; Bot2's Llanowar
# Elves, an Elf, gets nothing (1/1). Islandwalk (CR 702.14c): the Scout can't be blocked while the defending player
# controls an Island, and Bot2 controls one - the refusal "! Bot2.Block(Llanowar Elves > Cenote Scout)" holds, while the
# same Elves may block the Lord (the positive control). The Lord kills the 1/1 Elves and takes 1; the unblocked Scout
# deals 2: Bot2 goes to 18. The Scout's explore on turn 1 reveals an Island, which goes to Bot1's hand (CR 701.44a).

